# File Structure

## Directory Layout

- **Root** — Add-on entry point and core modules
  - `run.py` — Main add-on entry point
  - `acme_manager.py`, `certificate_manager.py`, `onecom_api.py` — Core modules
  - `config.yaml` — Add-on configuration schema
  - `Dockerfile`, `build.yaml` — Build configuration
  - `requirements.txt` — Python dependencies (production + dev)
  - `translations/` — Add-on UI translations (`en.yaml`, `de.yaml`)

- **`custom_components/onecom_dyndns/`** — Home Assistant integration
  - `__init__.py` — Integration setup, coordinator, service registration
  - `config_flow.py` — Configuration flow (user + hassio discovery)
  - `const.py` — Constants and `get_device_info()` helper
  - `sensor.py`, `binary_sensor.py`, `button.py` — Entity platforms
  - `onecom_api.py` — Integration-specific API wrapper
  - `services.yaml` — Service definitions
  - `strings.json` — Translation source; `manifest.json` — Integration metadata
  - `translations/` — Component translations (`en.json`, `de.json`)
  - `icon.png`, `logo.png` — Integration branding

- **`tests/`** — Pytest test suite
  - `conftest.py` — HA stubs and shared fixtures
  - `test_<module>.py` — One test file per source module

## Naming Conventions

- Test files: `test_<module>.py`
- Entity platforms: `<entity_type>.py` (sensor.py, binary_sensor.py, button.py)
- Constants: `const.py`
- Translations: `strings.json` (source), `translations/<lang>.json` (copies)
